  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01338-000:NotesRegardingCompensationForTransferELTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※５　移転補償金は当社仙台工場内建物の移転に伴うものであります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E01338-000:NotesRegardingCompensationForTransferELTextBlock>
